        "endIndex": 4528,
        "text": "** Notable open-source developer tooling launch from a major frontier lab"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4536,
        "endIndex": 4765,
        "text": "### **Candidate [19]: Tim Cook praises Australia's social media laws as 'world-leading', PM says**\n* **What is confirmed:** Australian Prime Minister Anthony Albanese visited Apple Park and met with Apple Executive Chair Tim Cook"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
