        "endIndex": 5596,
        "text": "### **Candidate [0]: ZuckOff app detects nearby smart glasses via Bluetooth**\n* **What is confirmed:** Developer Pawel Szydlowski launched \"ZuckOff,\" an app available on iOS and Android that scans local Bluetooth LE advertising signatures to flag nearby smart glasses (such as Ray-Ban Meta and Snap Spectacles)"
